}
#genericForm #translationQuantityWrap input{
  width:100%!important;
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header class="visual-header" aria-label="APSAN, LDA — Consulta de Preços">
  <div class="visual-header-media">
    <img class="visual-header-image" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="APSAN, LDA — Consulta de Preços — Angola e Namíbia">
    <div class="road-traffic" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="road-car car-a"><span class="roof"></span><span class="window w1"></span><span class="window w2"></span><span class="body"></span><span class="wheel wl"></span><span class="wheel wr"></span><span class="light l"></span><span class="light r"></span><span class="plate">N 6543 W</span></div>
      <div class="road-car car-b"><span class="roof"></span><span class="window w1"></span><span class="window w2"></span><span class="body"></span><span class="wheel wl"></span><span class="wheel wr"></span><span class="light l"></span><span class="light r"></span><span class="plate">N 6543 W</span></div>
      <div class="road-car car-c"><span class="roof"></span><span class="window w1"></span><span class="window w2"></span><span class="body"></span><span class="wheel wl"></span><span class="wheel wr"></span><span class="light l"></span><span class="light r"></span><span class="plate">N 6543 W</span></div>
      <div class="road-car car-d"><span class="roof"></span><span class="window w1"></span><span class="window w2"></span><span class="body"></span><span class="wheel wl"></span><span class="wheel wr"></span><span class="light l"></span><span class="light r"></span><span class="plate">N 6543 W</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="flight-motion" aria-hidden="true"><span class="flight-trail"></span><span class="flight-plane">✈</span></div>
    <button class="visual-header-cta" type="button" aria-label="Comece a sua consulta" onclick="document.getElementById('servicesPage').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'start'})"></button>
  </div>
</header>
<main class="card">
<section id="servicesPage">
<div class="services-head"><div class="tag">APSAN, LDA</div><h2>Serviços disponíveis</h2><p>Escolha o serviço que pretende consultar. Depois da escolha, esta página desaparece e será apresentada apenas a etapa correspondente ao serviço selecionado.</p></div><div class="services-grid">
<button class="service-card" onclick="openService('hospital')"><div class="service-icon"><img class="service-real-photo" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1576091160399-112ba8d25d1d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=300&q=85" alt="Acompanhamento hospitalar" loading="lazy"></div><div><strong>Acompanhamento Hospitalar</strong><span>Acompanhamento e apoio hospitalar na Namíbia.</span></div></button>
<button class="service-card" onclick="openService('shopping')"><div class="service-icon"><img class="service-real-photo" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542838132-92c53300491e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=300&q=85" alt="Compras na Namíbia" loading="lazy"></div><div><strong>Compras na Namíbia</strong><span>Prestação de serviço para compras na Namíbia.</span></div></button>
<button class="service-card" onclick="openService('pricecheck')"><div class="service-icon"><img class="service-real-photo" src="https://expertfrais.fr/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Inflation-alimentaire-ces-produits-du-quotidien-dont-le-prix-a-explose-en-2025-content.jpg" alt="Serviço APSAN" loading="lazy"></div><div><strong>Consultar Preços na Namíbia</strong><span>Consulta de preços e verificação de produtos na Namíbia.</span></div></button>
<button class="service-card" onclick="openService('shoppingescort')"><div class="service-icon"><img class="service-real-photo" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Serviço APSAN" loading="lazy"></div><div><strong>Acompanhamento para Compras na Namíbia</strong><span>Acompanhamento diário para realizar compras.</span></div></button>
